    kind: invariant  # 10c3
    title: "smart-test cannot associate a shipped YAML data file with its consuming tests, so a catalogue edit selects almost nothing and goes green — the manifest it writes for CI carries the same blind spot"  # 10c3
    status: violated  # 10c3
